<title>UK: Greek wheat vessel refloated in River Plate.</title>
<headline>Greek wheat vessel refloated in River Plate.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Greek-flag bulk carrier Anangel Wisdom, which ran aground in the River Plate on December 6, was refloated the following day and continued on its voyage, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The 22,353 dwt Anangel Wisdom was bound for Chile with a cargo of wheat.</p>
</text>
